 "_doc": "Audio event table (juice bible §4.6, UCA-F3, AUD-02): read by the Audio autoload (src/autoload/audio.gd), never by the simulation. `families`: per sample family (assets/audio/sfx/manifest.json) the measured onset and peak (ms into the file; tools: measured from the wavs), bus, per-family voice cap and minimum start spacing. `events`: a game event maps to layers so code calls Audio.event(id, pos, ctx) once. Layer fields: family (a template or a list of templates, first existing wins; {key} is replaced from ctx), gain_db, when (ctx condition: key, !key, key>=n, key<n), pitch {base, per_mass, clamp, jitter} (jitter from a stateless hash of ctx.seed, never double jitter), align onset|peak|start (onset: the transient lands on the event frame), bus (overrides the family bus), no_cut_ms (cannot be stolen for that long), priority (overrides the event's). Missing families are silent no-ops. `defaults`: values for families not listed.",
